      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the LLM provider for the Python script. I am currently focusing on how to integrate and identify Vertex AI within the code.\n\n\n**Implementing the Script**\n\nI'm now focused on building the `answer_with_context.py` file. I'm importing the necessary Vertex AI libraries and sketching out the function signature: `answer_question_with_context`. The goal is to make a function that takes both question and context strings, then returns an answer string generated by Vertex AI. I have a plan to initialize the Vertex AI client and text model, construct a prompt, and get a generated response. I'm ready to begin adding the basic structure of the script.\n\n\n",
